    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Medical College has launched a first-ever, monthly seminar series for undergraduate and graduate students. The series 'Dean's COVID-19 Seminar for Students' will feature alumni of the Medical College as guest speakers, who will share their perspectives, success stories, and the academic and clinical contributions they have been making during the pandemic.",
